TITLE='Authentic title "How People Treat You Once You Hit $1,000,000 Invested" promises a social-treatment payoff. The script argues the opposite: strangers do not change, family treats you worse if you tell, and only work and self-perception change. The promise is answered, but by contradicting its implied premise.'
